fee and Token A's interest. There may be significant error         in the returned values when `timestamp` is far beyond the last settlement."},"feeCollector()":{"notice":"Fee Collector address."},"fundActivityStartTime()":{"notice":"Start timestamp of the current primary market activity window."},"getRebalance(uint256)":{"notice":"Return the rebalance matrix at a given index. A zero struct is returned         if `index` is out of bound."},"getRebalanceSize()":{"notice":"Return the number of historical rebalances."},"getRebalanceTimestamp(uint256)":{"notice":"Return timestamp of the transaction triggering the rebalance at a given index.         Zero is returned if `index` is out of bound."},"getTotalShares()":{"notice":"Total shares of the fund, as if all Token A and B are merged."},"historicalInterestRate(uint256)":{"notice":"Mapping of trading week => interest rate of Token A.         Key is the end timestamp of a trading week. Value is the interest rate captured         after settlement of the last day of the previous trading week."},"historicalNavs(uint256)":{"notice":"Return NAV of Token M, A and B of the given trading day."},"historicalTotalShares(uint256)":{"notice":"Mapping of trading day => total fund shares.         Key is the end timestamp of a trading day. Value is the total fund shares after         settlement of that trading day, as if all Token A and B are merged."},"historicalUnderlying(uint256)":{"notice":"Mapping of trading day => underlying assets in the fund.         Key is the end timestamp of a trading day. Value is the underlying assets in         the fund after settlement of that trading day."},"isExchangeActive(uint256)":{"notice":"Return the status of the exchange. Unlike the primary market, exchange is         anonymous to fund"},"isFundActive(uint256)":{"notice":"Return the status of the fund contract."},"isPrimaryMarketActive(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Return the status of a given primary market contract."},"lowerRebalanceThreshold()":